#
# WHAT WAS CHECKED, AND HOW:
#   · all 46 flags this spec EMITS exist in arg.cpp's alias lists at the new pin
#     (cross-checked mechanically; the first instrument was wrong -- it missed
#     multi-alias entries like {"--typical", "--typical-p"} and reported 7 false
