# 🚨 THE ONE REAL CASUALTY, AND IT IS ON THE USER SURFACE, NOT HERE:
# --hf-repo-v / --hf-file-v (the VOCODER sub-model) WERE REMOVED UPSTREAM between the
# two pins. The whole vocoder option is gone from arg.cpp; only three tools/*/README.md
